msgstr "立即購買 %d 金幣（您有 %d）"

msgid "Promote %s"
msgstr "推廣%s"

msgid "XP %d/%d. Pick one promotion.%s"
msgstr "XP %d/%d。選擇一項促銷活動。 %s"

msgid "Has: %s"
msgstr "擁有：%s"

msgid "No promotion available right now."
msgstr "目前沒有促銷活動。"

msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "教學"

msgid "%d of %d"
msgstr "%d / %d"

msgid "%d more messages after this one"
msgstr "%d 此後還有更多消息"

msgid "%s gives:"
msgstr "%s 給出："

msgid "They"
msgstr "他們"

msgid "You give:"
msgstr "你給："

msgid "%d votes  %s"
msgstr "%d 投票 %s"

msgid "voted for %s"
msgstr "投票給 %s"

msgid "Tutorials can be turned off in Settings > Gameplay. They're all in the Civilopedia too."
msgstr "可在「設定 > 遊戲玩法」中關閉教學。所有教學也可在文明百科中查看。"

msgid " (%d turns)"
msgstr " (%d 回合)"

msgid "Choose a free great person"
msgstr "選擇一個免費的偉人"

msgid "You have %d free great people to pick."
msgstr "您有 %d 免費的優秀人才可供選擇。"

msgid "Vote for world leader"
msgstr "投票選出世界領袖"

msgid "Choose who should become the world leader and win a Diplomatic Victory!"
msgstr "選擇誰應該成為世界領袖並贏得外交勝利！"

msgid "Vote for %s"
msgstr "投票給%s"

msgid "Abstain"
msgstr "棄權"

msgid "Nothing being researched - pick a tech!"
msgstr "沒有正在研究的內容 - 選擇一項技術！"

msgid "Researching %s"
msgstr "研究%s"

msgid "You have %d free technologies to pick - choose a highlighted one."
msgstr "您有 %d 免費技術可供選擇 - 選擇突出顯示的一個。"

msgid "Science %+d per turn. Picking a later tech queues its prerequisites."
msgstr "科學每回合 %+d。選擇較晚的技術會對其先決條件進行排隊。"

msgid "%s turns"
msgstr "%s 回合"

msgid "Pick up where you left off, or start a new game."
msgstr "從上次停下的地方繼續，或開始新遊戲。"

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "繼續遊戲"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "繼續"

msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速啟動"

msgid "New game..."
msgstr "新遊戲..."

msgid "Load game..."
msgstr "載入遊戲..."

msgid "Civilopedia"
msgstr "文明百科"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "離開"

msgid "New game"
msgstr "新遊戲"

msgid "You"
msgstr "你"

msgid "World"
msgstr "世界"

msgid "Rules"
msgstr "規則"

msgid "Random"
msgstr "隨機"

msgid "%s  -  %s %s map, %s, %d AI, %d city-states"
msgstr "%s - %s %s 地圖、%s、%d AI、%d 城邦"

msgid "%s, led by %s"
msgstr "%s，領袖：%s"

msgid "Random: you'll find out who you are when the game starts."
msgstr "隨機：遊戲開始時你就會知道自己是誰。"

msgid "Your civilization"
msgstr "你的文明"

msgid "Map size"
msgstr "地圖尺寸"

msgid "Map type"
msgstr "地圖類型"

msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形狀"

msgid "Resources"
msgstr "資源"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "選項"

msgid "No ancient ruins"
msgstr "沒有古代遺跡"

msgid "No natural wonders"
msgstr "沒有自然奇觀"

msgid "Bigger maps slide under the table: hold a grip and drag, or use the overview at the far edge."
msgstr "較大的地圖會滑到桌子下方：按住並拖曳，或使用最遠邊緣的概覽。"

msgid "Gods & Kings adds religion, espionage, more civilizations and more units and buildings."
msgstr "《眾神與國王》增加了宗教、間諜活動、更多的文明以及更多的單位和建築。"

msgid "Difficulty"
